  "2948": {
    "solution": [
      {
        "msg": "## a)\n$B = (\\vec{b_1}, \\vec{b_2}, \\vec{b_3})$   \n$\\vec{b_1} = \\frac{1}{||1||}$   \n$||1|| = \\sqrt{\\int_1^51*1 dx}=\\sqrt{4}=2$   \n$\\vec{b_1} = \\frac{1}{2}$   \n   \n$\\vec{b_2} =\\frac{x-\\lang\\frac{1}{2},x\\rang\\frac{1}{2}}{||x-\\lang\\frac{1}{2},x\\rang\\frac{1}{2}||}$    \n$x-\\lang\\frac{1}{2},x\\rang\\frac{1}{2} = x-\\frac{1}{2}\\int_1^5\\frac{x}{2}dx=x-\\frac{1}{2}6=x-\\frac{6}{2}=x-3$   \n$||x-3||=\\sqrt{\\int_1^5(x-3)^2dx} =\\sqrt{\\frac{16}{3}}=\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{3}}$   \n$\\vec{b_2}=\\frac{x-3}{\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{3}}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4}$   \n   \n$\\vec{b_3} = \\frac{x^2-\\lang\\frac{1}{2},x^2\\rang\\frac{1}{2}-\\lang\\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4}, x^2\\rang\\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4}}{||x^2-\\lang\\frac{1}{2},x^2\\rang\\frac{1}{2}-\\lang\\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4}, x^2\\rang\\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4}||}$   \n$x^2-\\lang\\frac{1}{2},x^2\\rang\\frac{1}{2}-\\lang\\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4}, x^2\\rang\\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4} =x^2-\\frac{1}{2}\\int_1^5\\frac{x^2}{2}dx-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4}\\int_1^5x^2\\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4}dx=$   \n$=x^2-\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{62}{3}-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4}8\\sqrt3=x^2-\\frac{31}{3}-6(x-3)=x^2-6x+\\frac{23}{3}$   \n$||x^2-6x+\\frac{23}{3}|| = \\sqrt{\\int_1^5(x^2-6x+\\frac{23}{3})^2dx}=\\sqrt{\\frac{256}{45}}=\\frac{16}{3\\sqrt5}$   \n$\\vec{b_3}=\\frac{x^2-6x+\\frac{23}{3}}{\\frac{16}{3\\sqrt5}} = \\frac{3\\sqrt{5}}{16}(x^2-6x+\\frac{23}{3})$   \n   \n## b)   \n$\\vec{w}=\\lang\\vec{b_1},\\sin(x)\\rang\\vec{b_1}+\\lang\\vec{b_2},\\sin(x)\\rang\\vec{b_2}+\\lang\\vec{b_3},\\sin(x)\\rang\\vec{b_3}=$   \n$\\frac{1}{2}\\int_1^5\\frac{\\sin(x)}{2} dx + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4}\\int_1^5 \\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4}\\sin(x) dx + \\frac{3\\sqrt{5}}{16}(x^2-6x+\\frac{23}{3})\\int_1^5 \\frac{3\\sqrt{5}}{16}(x^2-6x+\\frac{23}{3})\\sin(x) dx=$   \n$=\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{\\cos(1)-\\cos(5)}{2})\n+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}(x-3)}{4}(-\\frac{\\sqrt3(\\sin(1)-\\sin(5)+2\\cos(1)+2\\cos(5)}{4})+$   \n$+\\frac{3\\sqrt{5}}{16}(x^2-6x+\\frac{23}{3})\\frac{5(6\\sin(1)+6(\\sin(5)+\\cos(1)-\\cos(5))}{8\\sqrt3}=$   \n$=x^2(\\frac{5\\sqrt{15}(6\\sin(1)+6\\sin(5)+\\cos(1)-\\cos(5))}{128})+$   \n$+x(-\\frac{15\\sqrt{15} (6\\sin(1)+6\\sin(5)+\\cos(1)-\\cos(5))}{64}-\\frac{3(\\sin(1)-\\sin(5)+2\\cos(1)+2\\cos(5)}{16})+$   \n$+(\\frac{115\\sqrt{15}(6\\sin(1)+6\\sin(5)+\\cos(1)-\\cos(5))}{384}+\\frac{9(\\sin(1)-\\sin(5)+2\\cos(1)+2\\cos(5))}{16}+\\frac{\\cos(1)-\\cos(5)}{4})$   \nCož se rovná přibližně $-0,053x^2-0,332x+1,601$   \n   \n## c)   \nOdmítám do wolframu přepisovat ten hnus, takže budu počítat s přibližnými hodnotami   \n$||\\sin(x)+0,053x^2+0,332x-1,601|| = \\sqrt{\\int_1^5(\\sin(x)+0,053x^2+0,332x-1,601)^2}=\\sqrt{0.101878}\\approx0.319$"
      }
    ]
  },
