  "3036": {
    "solution": [
      {
        "msg": "( a )\n\nMáme $\\langle 1,1\\rangle = \\int_1^5 1 \\ dx = 4$, a teda $\\|1\\|=2$. Preto $\\mathbf{u_1}=\\frac{1}{2}$. \n\nNech $\\mathbf{w_2}$ je ortogonálna projekcia vektoru $x$ do $\\text{Span}\\{\\mathbf{u_1}\\}$. Keďže $\\{\\mathbf{u_1}\\}$ je ortonormálna, platí $\\mathbf{w_2} = \\langle \\mathbf{u_1}, x \\rangle \\mathbf{u_1} = \\langle 1/2, x \\rangle 1/2$. Počítame \n$$ \\int_1^5 x/2 \\ dx = 6, $$\na teda $\\mathbf{w_2}=3$. Dostávame tak \n$$ \\mathbf{u_2}=\\frac{x-\\mathbf{w_2}}{ \\| x-\\mathbf{w_2} \\| }=\\frac{x-3}{ \\| x-3 \\| }. $$\nPočítame \n$$ \\int_1^5 (x-3)^2 \\ dx = 16/3 , $$\nteda $\\| x-3\\|=4/\\sqrt{3}$, a teda $\\mathbf{u_2}=\\frac{x-3}{4/\\sqrt{3}}$.\n\nNech $\\mathbf{w_3}$ je ortogonálna projekcia vektoru $x^2$ do $\\text{Span}\\{\\mathbf{u_1},\\mathbf{u_2}\\}$. Keďže $\\{\\mathbf{u_1},\\mathbf{u_2}\\}$ je ortonormálna, platí \n$$\\mathbf{w_3} = \\langle \\mathbf{u_1}, x^2 \\rangle \\mathbf{u_1} + \\langle \\mathbf{u_2}, x^2 \\rangle \\mathbf{u_2} = \\langle 1/2, x^2 \\rangle 1/2 + \\left\\langle \\frac{x-3}{4/\\sqrt{3}}, x^2 \\right\\rangle \\frac{x-3}{4/\\sqrt{3}} .$$ \nPočítame \n$$ \\int_1^5 x^2/2 \\ dx = 62/3, $$\n$$ \\int_1^5 x^2\\left(\\frac{x-3}{4/\\sqrt{3}}\\right) \\ dx = 8\\sqrt{3} , $$\na teda \n$$\\mathbf{w_3}=\\frac{62}{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} + 8\\sqrt{3}\\cdot\\frac{x-3}{4/\\sqrt{3}} = 6 (x - 3) + 31/3 .$$ \nDostávame tak \n$$ \\mathbf{u_3}=\\frac{x^2-\\mathbf{w_3}}{ \\| x^2-\\mathbf{w_3} \\| }=\\frac{x^2-6 (x - 3) - 31/3}{ \\| x^2-6 (x - 3) - 31/3 \\| }. $$\nPočítame \n$$ \\int_1^5 (x^2-6 (x - 3) - 31/3)^2 \\ dx = 256/45  , $$\nteda $\\| x^2-6 (x - 3) - 31/3\\|=16 \\sqrt{5}/15$, a teda \n$$\\mathbf{u_3}=\\frac{x^2-6 (x - 3) - 31/3}{16 \\sqrt{5}/15}.$$\nDostávame tak ortonormálnu bázu priestoru $\\text{Span}\\{1,x,x^2\\}$:\n$$B=(\\mathbf{u_1},\\mathbf{u_2},\\mathbf{u_3})=\\left( 1/2, \\ \\frac{x-3}{4/\\sqrt{3}}, \\ \\frac{x^2-6 (x - 3) - 31/3}{16 \\sqrt{5}/15} \\right).$$\n\n( b )\n\nNech $\\mathbf{w}$ je ortogonálna projekcia $\\sin(x)$ na priestor $\\text{Span}\\{1,x,x^2\\}$. Keďže $B$ je ortonormálna báza tohto priestoru, tak platí\n$$ \\mathbf{w} = \\langle \\mathbf{u_1}, \\sin(x)  \\rangle \\mathbf{u_1} + \\langle \\mathbf{u_2}, \\sin(x)  \\rangle \\mathbf{u_2} + \\langle \\mathbf{u_3}, \\sin(x)  \\rangle \\mathbf{u_3}. $$\nPočítame\n$$ \\int_1^5 \\sin(x)/2 \\ dx \\approx 0.128,  $$\n$$ \\int_1^5 \\sin(x)\\left( \\frac{x-3}{4/\\sqrt{3}} \\right) \\ dx \\approx -1.493,  $$\n$$ \\int_1^5 \\sin(x)\\left( \\frac{x^2-6 (x - 3) - 31/3}{16 \\sqrt{5}/15} \\right) \\ dx \\approx -0.125.  $$\nPotom \n$$\\mathbf{w}  \\approx  -0.0524078 x^2 - 0.332041 x + 1.60167. $$\n\n( c )\n\n$$\\| \\sin(x) - (-0.0524078 x^2 - 0.332041 x + 1.60167) \\| = $$\n$$=\\sqrt{\\int_1^5 (\\sin(x) +0.0524078 x^2 + 0.332041 x - 1.60167)^2   \\ dx  } = 0.31879.$$"
      }
    ]
  },
